  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The ascending order of acidity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>–</mo><mi>OH</mi></math> group in the following compounds is :</p><p>      (A) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Bu</mi><mo> </mo><mo>–</mo><mo> </mo><mi>OH</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0143_3845fdbd407d.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 399px;\"/></p><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo> </mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mo> </mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>)</mo><mo> </mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mo> </mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>)</mo><mo> </mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mo> </mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>)</mo><mo> </mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mo> </mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>)</mo></math>",
