      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo> </mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mo> </mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>)</mo><mo> </mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mo> </mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>)</mo><mo> </mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mo> </mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>)</mo><mo> </mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mo> </mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>)</mo></math>",
